      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 1,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "—It seems you're unaware of the matter.\r\nWell, that works out conveniently.\r\nI'll entrust you with it.",
        "Jp" : "――その様子では知らないようだな\r\nとなれば、好都合だ\r\nおまえに頼むことにしよう"
