      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 5,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "I heard several plausible rumors,\r\nbut when I checked, they were all baseless.",
        "Jp" : "それらしいウワサ話は幾つも聞いたが\r\n確認してみると、いい加減なものばかりだった"
